{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2022-11-30 10:30:00', 'title': "COMCAST NAMES CHRIS ROUSER SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF HUMAN RESOURCES AT COMPANY'S CENTRAL DIVISION HEADQUARTERS", 'text': 'ATLANTA--( BUSINESS WIRE )--COMCAST HAS ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF CHRIS ROUSER AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF HUMAN RESOURCES AT ITS CENTRAL DIVISION HEADQUARTERS IN ATLANTA, GEORGIA. IN THIS ROLE, ROUSER PROVIDES STRATEGIC LEADERSHIP AND DIRECTION FOR HUMAN RESOURCES FUNCTIONS, INCLUDING COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS, DIVERSITY, EMPLOYEE RELATIONS, LABOR RELATIONS, EMPLOYEE COMMUNICATIONS, POLICY, PERFORMANCE MANAGEMENT, TALENT ACQUISITION, AND TALENT MANAGEMENT.'}